    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172280/extras/76536794935e3709dda9cc68cf46f773.avif?t=1755538135\" width=599 height=214 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SEX Amnesia - Lover Sim</strong>\ud83d\udd1e is a wild mix of genres and emotions - a life once perfect, now turned upside down. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172280/extras/ff88449926c54d4439fef624ded6f567.avif?t=1755538135\" width=599 height=171 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An untroubled routine of serene daily life gets destroyed in one brief moment - a devastating fire leaves your girlfriend in a coma. You\u2019re heartbroken, lost, and left with so many questions unanswered that you start wondering about how and why, and little clues here and there raise even more questions whatsoever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172280/extras/140934f402750de1cb60d1a3dfcb1085.poster.avif?t=1755538135\" width=600 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172280/extras/140934f402750de1cb60d1a3dfcb1085.webm?t=1755538135\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172280/extras/140934f402750de1cb60d1a3dfcb1085.mp4?t=1755538135\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>A secret hidden behind all of this pulls you into one hell of a journey as you\u2019re tasked with rebuilding your relationship from scratch - after the coma she seems to have a severe amnesia case. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172280/extras/07ecbe77f62e848c6591422239ae7f63.avif?t=1755538135\" width=599 height=208 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From first dates to intimate moments, every step reveals more about her past and the mysteries surrounding the tragedy. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172280/extras/8f56f501504882f78920e7accd47bc6f.poster.avif?t=1755538135\" width=600 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172280/extras/8f56f501504882f78920e7accd47bc6f.webm?t=1755538135\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172280/extras/8f56f501504882f78920e7accd47bc6f.mp4?t=1755538135\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Explore many locations like parks, cinemas, and cafes as you navigate a world of love, suspense, and hidden truths. Plan your days carefully, balancing time between deepening your bond, solving mysteries, and taking on the challenges that threaten your happiness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172280/extras/ecef9945e4a00a9217b6fca0f5a80638.avif?t=1755538135\" width=599 height=338 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<strong>Someone will have to find out!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172280/extras/559c560a6f7d1e7ee1d5797b966d4274.poster.avif?t=1755538135\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172280/extras/559c560a6f7d1e7ee1d5797b966d4274.webm?t=1755538135\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172280/extras/559c560a6f7d1e7ee1d5797b966d4274.mp4?t=1755538135\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The day-and-night cycle and time-dependent actions enhance the gameplay, presenting fresh opportunities and unique interactions as the story unfolds. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172280/extras/21999ce6c20d29e3971453cba53133fc.avif?t=1755538135\" width=599 height=324 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<strong>Dive into Sex Amnesia: Lover Sim \ud83d\udd1e and find out!</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172280/extras/f31f2dd09cbf649bb7b7f9994d5e6e3b.poster.avif?t=1755538135\" width=600 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172280/extras/f31f2dd09cbf649bb7b7f9994d5e6e3b.webm?t=1755538135\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172280/extras/f31f2dd09cbf649bb7b7f9994d5e6e3b.mp4?t=1755538135\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172280/extras/677da2431f790b8745b7fdfbcbd6f117.avif?t=1755538135\" width=599 height=154 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Emotional storyline</strong>  \u2013